          "text": "In a bowl, combine eggs, herbs, cheese, cream, pepper and salt. Beat well."
        },
        {
          "step": 4,
          "text": "Rinse shredded potatoes in cold water. Drain well. Add potatoes to egg mixture. Stir in ham mixture. Blend well."
